      "value": "<div class=\"fn value\">\nNASA/Apollo 17 crew; taken by either <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harrison_Schmitt\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Harrison Schmitt\">Harrison Schmitt</a> or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ronald_Evans_(astronaut)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Ronald Evans (astronaut)\">Ron Evans</a></div>",
